<title>USA: New York soft commodities opening forecasts.</title>
<headline>New York soft commodities opening forecasts.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commodity traders expected soft commodity markets to open Wednesday as follows:</p>
<p>Coffee - 5.00 to 8.00 cents a lb lower</p>
<p>Cocoa  - $15 to $20 a tonne lower</p>
<p>World sugar - 0.15 cent a lb lower</p>
<p>((--New York Commodities Desk, 212-859-1640))</p>
</text>
